msgid "The COSMO model"
msgstr "COSMO 模型"

msgid ""
"The Conductor-like Screening Model (COSMO) (A. Klamt and G. Schüürmann, J. "
"Chem. Soc. Perkin Trans. II 799-805 (1993)) is currently available for HF "
"(``RHF,UHF``) and DFT (``RKS,UKS``) energy calculations and the "
"corresponding gradients."
msgstr ""
"类导体屏蔽模型（COSMO）（A. Klamt 和 G. Schüürmann, J. Chem. Soc. Perkin Trans. II "
"799-805 (1993)）目前可用于 HF（\\ ``RHF,UHF``\\ ）和 DFT（\\ ``RKS,UKS``\\ "
"）能量计算以及相应的梯度。"

msgid "The COSMO model is invoked by the ``COSMO`` card:"
msgstr "COSMO 模型通过 ``COSMO`` 卡片调用："

msgid "where option can be"
msgstr "其中 option 可以是"

msgid ""
"``NPPA`` size of the underlying basis grid. The value must satisfy: "
":math:`value = 10 \\times 3^k \\times 4^l +2` (default = 1082; type "
"integer)."
msgstr ""
"``NPPA`` 基础网格的大小。该值必须满足：\\ :math:`value = 10 \\times 3^k \\times 4^l +2`\\ "
"（默认值 = 1082；类型为整数）。"

msgid ""
"``NSPA`` number of segments for non hydrogen atoms. The value must satisfy: "
":math:`values = 10 \\times 3^k \\times 4^l +2` (default = 92; type integer)."
msgstr ""
"``NSPA`` 非氢原子的分段数。该值必须满足：\\ :math:`values = 10 \\times 3^k \\times 4^l +2`\\"
" （默认值 = 92；类型为整数）。"

msgid ""
"``CAVITY`` the intersection seams of the molecular surface are closed (1) or"
" open (0) (default = 1; type integer)."
msgstr "``CAVITY`` 分子表面的交线是闭合（1）还是开放（0）（默认值 = 1；类型为整数）。"

msgid ""
"``EPSILON`` dielectric permittivity (default = -1.d0, which means "
":math:`\\epsilon=\\infty`; type real)"
msgstr "``EPSILON`` 介电常数（默认值 = -1.d0，表示 :math:`\\epsilon=\\infty`\\ ；类型为实数）"

msgid ""
"``DISEX`` distance criteria for the :math:`\\bf A`-matrix setup. Short range"
" interactions (segment centre distances :math:`<` DISEX :math:`\\times` mean"
" atomic diameter) are calculated using the underlying basis grid. Long range"
" interactions are calculated via the segment centres (default = 10.d0; type "
"float)."
msgstr ""
"``DISEX`` 用于 :math:`\\bf A` 矩阵设置的距离判据。短程相互作用（片段中心距离 :math:`<` DISEX "
":math:`\\times` 平均原子直径）使用底层基础网格计算。长程相互作用通过片段中心计算（默认值 = 10.d0；类型为浮点数）。"

msgid ""
"``ROUTF`` factor used for outer cavity construction. The radii of the outer "
"cavity are defined as: :math:`r^{out}_i=r_i+ROUTF \\times RSOLV` (default = "
"0.85d0; type float)"
msgstr ""
"``ROUTF`` 用于外腔构造的因子。外腔半径定义为：\\ :math:`r^{out}_i=r_i+ROUTF \\times RSOLV`\\ "
"（默认值 = 0.85d0；类型为浮点数）"

msgid ""
"``PHSRAN`` phase offset of coordinate randomization (default = 0.d0; type "
"float)"
msgstr "``PHSRAN`` 坐标随机化的相位偏移（默认值 = 0.d0；类型为浮点数）"

msgid ""
"``AMPRAN`` amplitude factor of coordinate randomization (default = 1.0d-5; "
"type float)"
msgstr "``AMPRAN`` 坐标随机化的振幅因子（默认值 = 1.0d-5；类型为浮点数）"

msgid ""
"``RSOLV`` additional radius for cavity construction (default = -1d0, the "
"optimized H radius is used; type float)."
msgstr "``RSOLV`` 用于腔体构造的附加半径（默认值 = -1d0，使用优化的H原子半径；类型为浮点数）。"

msgid ""
"``MAXNPS`` maximal number of surface segments (default = -1, will be "
"estimated; type integer)."
msgstr "``MAXNPS`` 表面片段的最大数量（默认值 = -1，将由程序估算；类型为整数）。"

msgid ""
"It is recommended to change the default values for problematic cases only."
msgstr "建议仅在遇到问题的情况下更改默认值。"

msgid "where the *radius* has to be given in Å."
msgstr "其中\\ *半径*\\ 必须以Å为单位给出。"

msgid "BASIC THEORY"
msgstr "基本理论"

msgid ""
"COSMO is a continuum solvation model, in which the solvent is represented as"
" a dielectric continuum of permittivity :math:`\\epsilon`. The solute "
"molecule is placed in a cavity inside the continuum. The response of the "
"continuum due to the charge distribution of the solute is described by the "
"generation of a screening charge distribution on the cavity surface. This "
"charge distribution can be calculated by solving the boundary equation of "
"vanishing electrostatic potential on the surface of a conductor. After a "
"discretization of the cavity surface into sufficiently small segments, the "
"vector of the screening charges on the surface segments is"
msgstr ""
"COSMO 是一种连续介质溶剂化模型，其中溶剂被表示为介电常数为 :math:`\\epsilon` "
"的介电连续介质。溶质分子被放置在连续介质内部的一个空腔中。连续介质对溶质电荷分布的响应通过空腔表面生成屏蔽电荷分布来描述。该电荷分布可以通过求解导体表面静电势为零的边界方程来计算。将空腔表面离散化为足够小的片段后，表面片段上的屏蔽电荷向量为"

msgid "{\\bf q^{*}} = -{\\bf A^{-1}} \\Phi"
msgstr ""
"{\\bf q^{*}} = -{\\bf A^{-1}} \\Phi\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"where :math:`\\Phi` is the vector of the potential due to the solute charge "
"distribution on the segments, and :math:`\\bf A` is the interaction matrix "
"of the screening charges on the segments. This solution is exact for an "
"electric conductor. For finite dielectrics the true dielectric screening "
"charges can be approximated very well by scaling the charge density of a "
"conductor with :math:`f(\\epsilon)`."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\Phi` 是溶质电荷分布在片段上产生的电势向量，\\ :math:`\\bf A` "
"是片段上屏蔽电荷的相互作用矩阵。此解对于电导体是精确的。对于有限介电常数的情况，真实的介电屏蔽电荷可以通过用 :math:`f(\\epsilon)` "
"缩放导体的电荷密度来很好地近似。"

msgid ""
"{\\bf q} = f(\\epsilon) {\\bf q^{*}} ; \\quad f(\\epsilon) = (\\epsilon - "
"1)/(\\epsilon + 0.5)"
msgstr ""
"{\\bf q} = f(\\epsilon) {\\bf q^{*}} ; \\quad f(\\epsilon) = (\\epsilon - 1)/(\\epsilon + 0.5)\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"In every SCF step the screening charges :math:`\\bf q` have to be generated "
"from the potential :math:`\\Phi`, and then added to the Hamiltonian as "
"external point charges. The total energy of the system is"
msgstr ""
"在每个 SCF 步骤中，必须从电势 :math:`\\Phi` 生成屏蔽电荷 :math:`\\bf q`\\ "
"，然后将其作为外部点电荷添加到哈密顿量中。系统的总能量为"

msgid "E_{tot} = E_{0} + E_{diel}; \\quad E_{diel} = \\frac{1}{2} \\Phi {\\bf q}"
msgstr ""
"E_{tot} = E_{0} + E_{diel}; \\quad E_{diel} = \\frac{1}{2} \\Phi {\\bf q}\n"
"\n"
